<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zoltek raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zoltek raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term rating on Zoltek Cos Inc accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose three to 34-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
